Package: capsa-python-runtime
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Roman <roman@nekko.ai>
Section: python
Priority: optional
Depends: @SHLIBDEPS@
Homepage: https://github.com/nekkoai/capsa
Description: private CPython runtime for Capsa federation components
 This package provides the pinned private CPython 3.12 runtime and the
 production-only Python dependency closure used by Capsa federation components.
 It installs no application code, service, virtual environment, pip bootstrap,
 or install-time network or service action.
